{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1957","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. A BIT of an Inequality"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$. Find the number of tuples ($$$x, y, z$$$) such that: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1 \\leq x \\leq y \\leq z \\leq n$$$, and "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(x, y) \\oplus f(y, z) \\gt f(x, z)$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We define $$$f(l, r) = a_l \\oplus a_{l + 1} \\oplus \\ldots \\oplus a_{r}$$$, where $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a_i \\leq 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer on a new line — the number of described tuples."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n3\n6 2 4\n1\n3\n5\n7 3 7 2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n0\n16\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first case, there are 4 such tuples in the array $$$[6, 2, 4]$$$: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" ($$$1$$$, $$$2$$$, $$$2$$$): $$$(a_1 \\oplus a_2) \\oplus (a_2) = 4 \\oplus 2 \\gt (a_1 \\oplus a_2) = 4$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" ($$$1$$$, $$$1$$$, $$$3$$$): $$$(a_1) \\oplus (a_1 \\oplus a_2 \\oplus a_3) = 6 \\oplus 0 \\gt (a_1 \\oplus a_2 \\oplus a_3) = 0$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" ($$$1$$$, $$$2$$$, $$$3$$$): $$$(a_1 \\oplus a_2) \\oplus (a_2 \\oplus a_3) = 4 \\oplus 6 \\gt (a_1 \\oplus a_2 \\oplus a_3) = 0$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" ($$$1$$$, $$$3$$$, $$$3$$$): $$$(a_1 \\oplus a_2 \\oplus a_3) \\oplus (a_3) = 0 \\oplus 4 \\gt (a_1 \\oplus a_2 \\oplus a_3) = 0$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, there are no such tuples."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1957D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1957/problem/D"}